description: "Source:\n\nfn test(n: u8) -> u8 {\n    match n {\n        1 => {\n            10\n        },\n        _ => {\n            0\n        },\n    }\n}\n"
---
T-Fn: test => u8
  T-ReturnTail: match n {
    1 => {
        10
    },
    _ => {
        0
    },
} => u8
    T-Match: {n: u8, test: fn(n: u8) -> u8} ⊢ match n {
    1 => {
        10
    },
    _ => {
        0
    },
} ⇒ i64
      T-Var: {n: u8, test: fn(n: u8) -> u8} ⊢ n ⇒ u8
      Unify-Var: u8 ~ i64 => {u8/t3}
      T-Tail: 10 => i64
        T-Int: {n: u8, test: fn(n: u8) -> u8} ⊢ 10 ⇒ i64
      T-Tail: 0 => i64
        T-Int: {n: u8, test: fn(n: u8) -> u8} ⊢ 0 ⇒ i64
      Unify-Var: i64 ~ i64 => i64
    Unify-Var: i64 ~ u8 => {u8/t4}
